WEBVTT

00:00:00.116 --> 00:00:05.180
This video shows how an administrator reviews a leave request on a phone.

00:00:06.848 --> 00:00:16.448
Tap the menu button at the top left, open HR and Staff, and choose Leave. The Applications tab lists the requests as cards.

00:00:19.289 --> 00:00:28.025
Find the request marked Pending. The card shows the staff member, the leave type, the dates, the number of days and the reason.

00:00:28.488 --> 00:00:44.232
Tap Approve at the bottom of the card. A window opens where you can add remarks, here a short note. Tap Approve again to confirm. A message says the leave was approved. To say no instead, tap Reject.

00:00:55.163 --> 00:00:57.827
The card now shows Approved.

00:01:01.231 --> 00:01:09.535
The request is approved. You can filter by status any time to see the pending, approved or rejected requests.
